---
output: svg
---
@startuml
binary "Binary Serial Data" as D
robust "Robust" as R
concise "Concise" as C

@-3
D is low: idle
R is lo: idle
C is 1: idle
@-1
D is high: start
R is hi: start
C is 0: start

@0
D is low: 1 lsb
R is lo: 1 lsb
C is 1: lsb

@1
D is high: 0
R is hi: 0
C is 0

@6
D is low: 1
R is lo: 1
C is 1

@7
D is high: 0 msb
R is hi: 0 msb
C is 0: msb

@8
D is low: stop
R is lo: stop
C is 1: stop

@0 <-> @8 : Serial data bits for ASCII "A" (Little Endian)
@enduml
